created: 2023-03-07, last updated: 2026-07-24, [Read more](https://docs.geldata.com/reference/datamodel/triggers)

Any query in your trigger will return the state of the database *after* the triggering query.
...
```
type Log {
action: str;
timestamp: datetime {
default := datetime_current();
}
target_name: str;
change: str;
}
```
...
In a trigger's expression, we have access to the `__old__` and/or `__new__`
variables which capture the object before and after the query.
...
